{"page":554,"verses":[{"verse_key":"62:9","surah":62,"ayah":9,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوٓا۟ إِذَا نُودِىَ لِلصَّلَوٰةِ مِن يَوْمِ ٱلْجُمُعَةِ فَٱسْعَوْا۟ إِلَىٰ ذِكْرِ ٱللَّهِ وَذَرُوا۟ ٱلْبَيْعَ ۚ ذَٰلِكُمْ خَيْرٌ لَّكُمْ إِن كُنتُمْ تَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Believers! When the call to prayer is made on the day of congregation, hurry towards the reminder of God and leave off your trading––that is better for you, if only you knew––","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"62:9"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(you) who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"62:9"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"62:9"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"When","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"62:9"},{"pos":5,"ar":"نُودِىَ","en_gloss":"(the) call is made","transliteration":"nūdiya","verse_key":"62:9"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لِلصَّلَوٰةِ","en_gloss":"for (the) prayer","transliteration":"lilṣṣalati","verse_key":"62:9"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"62:9"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَوْمِ","en_gloss":"(the) day","transliteration":"yawmi","verse_key":"62:9"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْجُمُعَةِ","en_gloss":"(of) Friday","transliteration":"l-jumuʿati","verse_key":"62:9"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَٱسْعَوْا۟","en_gloss":"then hasten","transliteration":"fa-is'ʿaw","verse_key":"62:9"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"62:9"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ذِكْرِ","en_gloss":"(the) remembrance","transliteration":"dhik'ri","verse_key":"62:9"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"62:9"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَذَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"and leave","transliteration":"wadharū","verse_key":"62:9"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْبَيْعَ ۚ","en_gloss":"the business","transliteration":"l-bayʿa","verse_key":"62:9"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ذَٰلِكُمْ","en_gloss":"That","transliteration":"dhā