"so they","transliteration":"fahum","verse_key":"63:3"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"63:3"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَفْقَهُونَ","en_gloss":"understand","transliteration":"yafqahūna","verse_key":"63:3"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٣","en_gloss":"(3)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"63:3"}]},{"verse_key":"63:4","surah":63,"ayah":4,"ar_uthmani":"۞ وَإِذَا رَأَيْتَهُمْ تُعْجِبُكَ أَجْسَامُهُمْ ۖ وَإِن يَقُولُوا۟ تَسْمَعْ لِقَوْلِهِمْ ۖ كَأَنَّهُمْ خُشُبٌ مُّسَنَّدَةٌ ۖ يَحْسَبُونَ كُلَّ صَيْحَةٍ عَلَيْهِمْ ۚ هُمُ ٱلْعَدُوُّ فَٱحْذَرْهُمْ ۚ قَـٰتَلَهُمُ ٱللَّهُ ۖ أَنَّىٰ يُؤْفَكُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When you see them [Prophet], their outward appearance pleases you; when they speak, you listen to what they say. But they are like propped-up tim-bers––they think every cry they hear is against them––and they are the enemy. Beware of them. May God confound them! How devious they are!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"63:4"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رَأَيْتَهُمْ","en_gloss":"you see them","transliteration":"ra-aytahum","verse_key":"63:4"},{"pos":3,"ar":"تُعْجِبُكَ","en_gloss":"pleases you","transliteration":"tuʿ'jibuka","verse_key":"63:4"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَجْسَامُهُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"their bodies","transliteration":"ajsāmuhum","verse_key":"63:4"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"and if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"63:4"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَقُولُوا۟","en_gloss":"they speak","transliteration":"yaqūlū","verse_key":"63:4"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تَسْمَعْ","en_gloss":"you listen","transliteration":"tasmaʿ","verse_key":"63:4"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لِقَوْلِهِمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"to their speech","transliteration":"liqawlihim","verse_key":"63:4"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كَأَنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"as if they (were)","transliteration":"ka-annahum","verse_key":"63:4"},{"pos":10,"ar":"خُشُبٌۭ","en_gloss":"pieces of wood","transliteration":"khushubun","verse_key":"63:4"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مُّسَنَّدَةٌۭ ۖ","en_g